<title>GERMANY: Volksfuersorge to pay 15 dmk 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Volksfuersorge to pay 15 dmk 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>German insurance group Volksfuersorge Holding AG said on Thursday it would pay a dividend of 15 marks on its 1996 results.</p>
<p>The company, a unit of AMB Holding had earlier this year said it expected its results for 1996 to match the previous year.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
